# Discover only when the queue is thin

**Business rule:** Do not run **Discover jobs (daily)** when sheet `Status=New` count is still **greater than 3× `DAILY_APPLY_LIMIT`** (default 20 → skip when New > 60).

**SSOT:** `shouldSkipDiscoveryForQueueDepth()` in `src/discovery/queue-mix.ts`, enforced in `runDiscovery()` before any board scan.

**n8n:** `Collect URLs` must pass `newQueueStats.statusNew` (all `New` rows, any category) to `POST /discover/scan`.

**Ops:** If discover ran while New was above threshold, fix apply blockers and re-run apply — do not add more rows.
